    {"symbol": "🧾", "tooltip": "The audit trail is a receipt for an injury — proof the harm happened, not power to undo it or get paid for it."},
    {"symbol": "🔑", "tooltip": "Subject-keyed sounds like the subject holds the key, but the decryption authority concentrates one layer up in auditors and law firms."}
  ],
