    {"claim": "Expanded discovery empowers well-resourced litigants, not the gig worker whose pay was set by an algorithm they'll never afford to subpoena.", "targets": ["AN-2"], "relationship": "extends"},
    {"claim": "The thing that reaches behavior is outcome liability assigned at the deployment handoff; logging never reaches behavior, and that's the whole problem.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""}
